    {
      "source": "Event published as early as conceivably possible as soon as a <a href=\"../../SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a>\nhas been started - before the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> is\navailable, but after the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationListener</code></a>s have been registered. The source\nof the event is the <a href=\"../../SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a> itself, but beware of using its internal\nstate too much at this early stage since it might be modified later in the lifecycle.",
      "translation": "事件在 `<a href=\"../../SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a>` 启动后尽早发布——在 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>` 或 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>` 可用之前，但在 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationListener</code></a>` 注册之后。事件的源是 `<a href=\"../../SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a>` 本身，但请注意在此早期阶段不要过度使用其内部状态，因为它可能在生命周期后期被修改。",
      "count": 2
    },
